      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://touristplaces.guide/top-10-must-visit-tourist-places-in-worcester/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The arrival of the railroad in the 19th century brought new opportunities, connecting Worcester to larger markets and facilitating local business growth.",
